---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { profile } from '../data/profile';
import { education } from '../data/experience';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Prateek Mittal"
  description="Personal biography, background, and perspectives of Prateek Mittal."
>
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 py-8 sm:py-12 space-y-10 sm:space-y-12">
    
    <!-- Page Header -->
    <div class="space-y-2 border-b border-warm-200 dark:border-warm-800 pb-6">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif font-medium text-warm-900 dark:text-warm-50 tracking-tight">
        About Me
      </h1>
      <p class="text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 font-sans text-sm">
        Background, research interests, and personal perspectives.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 2-Column Responsive Layout -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-10 items-start">
      
      <!-- Main Content: Justified Long-Form Narrative in Editorial Serif -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-8 space-y-5 font-serif text-[17px] text-stone-800 dark:text-stone-200 leading-[1.85] text-justified hyphens-auto">
        <p>
          I have always felt that mathematics, social conscience, and poetry are not separate endeavors, but three dialects of the same quiet search for clarity.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-medium text-warm-900 dark:text-warm-50 pt-3 text-left">
          Medical AI & Academic Research
        </h2>
        <p>
          In academic research, I work on problems where differential geometry and statistical theory help us interpret biological complexity. With the <strong>VEDAs Lab</strong> and my co-authors, this has led to five accepted contributions at <strong>MICCAI 2026</strong> (including three oral presentations and the MICCAI Society Travel Grant) and theoretical work on robust high-dimensional subsampling published in <strong>Transactions on Machine Learning Research (TMLR)</strong>.
        </p>
        <p>
          At <strong>Yale University</strong>, I contributed to <strong>BrainLM</strong> (ICLR 2024)—a foundation model trained on 6,700 hours of whole-brain fMRI recordings to decode human cognitive states from non-invasive functional neuroimaging.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-medium text-warm-900 dark:text-warm-50 pt-3 text-left">
          Industry & Enterprise Decision Science
        </h2>
        <p>
          In industry, I work as an AI Decision Science Analyst within <strong>Accenture Strategy & Consulting</strong>'s AI & Data ecosystem in Gurugram, contributing to backend development, problem framing, and enterprise transformation workflows.
        </p>
        <p>
          Prior to Accenture, I was a Data Scientist – Assistant Manager at <strong>Dr. Lal PathLabs</strong>, where I built automated OCR document extraction pipelines using Azure Document Intelligence, doctor-facing WhatsApp RAG assistants, and unified health-score frameworks tailored to Indian reference intervals.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-medium text-warm-900 dark:text-warm-50 pt-3 text-left">
          Ethics & Grassroots Foundations
        </h2>
        <p>
          Because technology is only as good as its safety in the hands of vulnerable patients, I founded the <strong>Foundation for Ethical AI in Healthcare</strong>—a Section 8 initiative aimed at addressing the regulatory and clinical accountability gap for clinical algorithms in India (published in <em>Health Policy and Technology</em>).
        </p>
        <p>
          Earlier during my Bachelor’s degree in Computer Engineering at Thapar Institute, I spent four formative years with <strong>Pratigya Abhiyan</strong>. Starting as a volunteer educator teaching children from daily-wage worker families and later serving as Academic Head, it grounded my understanding of education, empathy, and social responsibility.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-medium text-warm-900 dark:text-warm-50 pt-3 text-left">
          Poetry & The Quiet Hours
        </h2>
        <p>
          When work is done, I write poetry in Hindi and English. My writing revolves around themes of <em>भीतर का ठिकाना</em> (the inner refuge) and <em>क्षीर-नीर विवेक</em> (the classical philosophical ideal of separating essence from noise). It is how I stay grounded, thoughtful, and human.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Sidebar: Portrait & Quick Facts -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-4 space-y-6">
        <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-warm-200 dark:border-warm-800 bg-warm-50 dark:bg-warm-900/60 p-4 shadow-sm space-y-4">
          <div class="aspect-[4/4.5] w-full rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-warm-200 dark:bg-warm-800">
            <img
              src="/images/prateek.png"
              alt="Prateek Mittal"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top"
            />
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-2 text-xs font-sans text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-300 divide-y divide-warm-200/80 dark:divide-warm-800/80">
            <div class="pt-1">
              <span class="text-stone-400 block">Name</span>
              <span class="font-medium text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">Prateek Mittal</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pt-2">
              <span class="text-stone-400 block">Location</span>
              <span class="font-medium text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">Gurugram & Faridabad, India</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pt-2">
              <span class="text-stone-400 block">Current Focus</span>
              <span class="font-medium text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">Decision Science @ Accenture</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pt-2">
              <span class="text-stone-400 block">Research</span>
              <span class="font-medium text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">Medical AI · VEDAs Lab & Yale</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Contact Box -->
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-warm-200 dark:border-warm-800 p-4 text-xs font-sans space-y-2">
          <h3 class="font-serif font-medium text-sm text-warm-900 dark:text-warm-50">Get in touch</h3>
          <p class="text-stone-500">
            Feel free to write for research collaborations or discussions:
          </p>
          <a
            href="mailto:prateekmittal154@gmail.com"
            class="text-brick-600 dark:text-brick-500 font-medium hover:underline block pt-1"
          >
            prateekmittal154@gmail.com &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>
